config HTC_RADIO_SMEM
	bool "HTC radio shared memory (AP run-mode handshake)"
	depends on OF
	default n
	help
	  Writes a 1 KiB structure to a fixed region in DRAM. The MPSS on
	  HTC devices reads this at boot to determine the execution state
	  of the Application Processor (bootloader, FTM, recovery, or HLOS).

	  Without this, the modem boots in a restricted mode. While RF and
	  SIM remain functional, it does not expose the QMUX control SMD
	  channels (DATA5_CNTL/DATA40_CNTL), causing qmuxd to fail with
	  -ENODEV and breaking telephony.

	  Required for the HTC Desire 530 (a16).
